  "how1T": "Install and start",
  "how1B": "When you first open Zad X, create the parent PIN, then add your child from the Parent dashboard and pick your country from the globe icon.",
  "how2T": "Set up tasks",
  "how2B": "Must-do tasks unlock screen time; bonus tasks add more minutes.",
  "how3T": "Your child finishes a task",
  "how3B": "They tap \"Done\" on the Tasks page and you're notified right away.",
  "how4T": "Approve from your phone",
  "how4B": "Once you approve, the minutes are added and locked apps open for that time.",
  "how5T": "The adhan locks play",
  "how5B": "At every adhan, apps lock until your child prays and you approve. On the free plan they open again by themselves after the prayer time.",
  "faq1Q": "How do games and apps unlock?",
  "faq1A": "Your child finishes the must-do tasks and a parent approves; then locked apps open for the minutes earned. On the free plan, apps stay open up to the daily screen time you set.",
  "faq2Q": "What happens at the adhan?",
  "faq2A": "The adhan plays and apps lock until your child taps \"I prayed\" and a parent approves. On the free plan they open again by themselves after the prayer time.",
  "faq3Q": "How do I change my country or prayer times?",
  "faq3A": "Tap the globe icon at the top and pick your country and city; the calculation method is set automatically.",
  "faq4Q": "Does Zad X control PlayStation?",
  "faq4A": "Not directly. We notify you and you allow or pause play from PlayStation Family.",
  "faq5Q": "Can my child turn off the lock?",
  "faq5A": "No. The lock works at the device level and parent settings are PIN-protected.",
  "faq6Q": "What do I install, and where?",
  "faq6A": "The same Zad X app on your phone and on your child's phone or tablet. For a Windows PC there's Zad X Guard; its link is in the Parent dashboard.",
  "faq7Q": "How do I add a child?",
  "faq7A": "Open the Parent dashboard with your PIN, tap \"Add a child\" and pick a name and avatar. Free covers 1 child, Basic 2, and Plus up to 5.",
  "faq8Q": "How do I link my child's phone to mine?",
  "faq8A": "On your phone: Parent dashboard → Link devices → pick the child → \"Create a link code\". On the child's device: globe icon → \"Have a link code?\" and enter it within 10 minutes.",
  "faq9Q": "Can I use just one device?",
  "faq9A": "Yes. Install Zad X on your child's device only and open the Parent dashboard there with your PIN.",
  "faq10Q": "How do I pay? Will I get a code after paying?",
  "faq10A": "You subscribe inside the app through Google Play or the App Store with your store account; no code or password is sent to you. Renew or cancel from the store's Subscriptions page.",
  "faq11Q": "New phone: will my subscription come back?",
  "faq11A": "Sign in with the same store account you paid with, open Plans and tap \"Restore purchases\".",
  "faq12Q": "I forgot my PIN?",
  "faq12A": "Your PIN is stored only on this device, and nobody can see it, not even us. Choose one you'll remember and keep it away from your child.",
